<div id="penalized-regression" class="section level1">
<h1>Penalized Regression</h1>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb35"><pre class="sourceCode r"><code class="sourceCode r"><span id="cb35-1"><a href="#cb35-1" tabindex="-1"></a>x_train <span class="ot">&lt;-</span> <span class="fu">model.matrix</span>(HeatingLoad <span class="sc">~</span> ., train_data)[, <span class="sc">-</span><span class="dv">1</span>]</span>
