<span id="cb35-4"><a href="#cb35-4" tabindex="-1"></a>y_test  <span class="ot">&lt;-</span> test_data<span class="sc">$</span>HeatingLoad</span>
<span id="cb35-5"><a href="#cb35-5" tabindex="-1"></a></span>
