<div id="conditional-inference-tree" class="section level2">
<h2>Conditional Inference Tree</h2>
<p>The conditional inference tree is fitted independently within each
branch. Therefore, the same predictor can appear in more than one branch
when it is statistically informative for different subgroups of the
data.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb83"><pre class="sourceCode r"><code class="sourceCode r"><span id="cb83-1"><a href="#cb83-1" tabindex="-1"></a>fit_ctree <span class="ot">&lt;-</span> partykit<span class="sc">::</span><span class="fu">ctree</span>(</span>
<span id="cb83-2"><a href="#cb83-2" tabindex="-1"></a>  HeatingLoad <span class="sc">~</span> .,</span>
<span id="cb83-3"><a href="#cb83-3" tabindex="-1"></a>  <span class="at">data =</span> train_data,</span>
<span id="cb83-4"><a href="#cb83-4" tabindex="-1"></a>  <span class="at">control =</span> partykit<span class="sc">::</span><span class="fu">ctree_control</span>(</span>
<span id="cb83-5"><a href="#cb83-5" tabindex="-1"></a>    <span class="at">mincriterion =</span> <span class="fl">0.99</span>,</span>
<span id="cb83-6"><a href="#cb83-6" tabindex="-1"></a>    <span class="at">minsplit =</span> <span class="dv">100</span>,</span>
<span id="cb83-7"><a href="#cb83-7" tabindex="-1"></a>    <span class="at">minbucket =</span> <span class="dv">50</span>,</span>
<span id="cb83-8"><a href="#cb83-8" tabindex="-1"></a>    <span class="at">maxdepth =</span> <span class="dv">2</span></span>
<span id="cb83-9"><a href="#cb83-9" tabindex="-1"></a>  )</span>
<span id="cb83-10"><a href="#cb83-10" tabindex="-1"></a>)</span>
<span id="cb83-11"><a href="#cb83-11" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="fu">plot</span>(</span>
<span id="cb83-12"><a href="#cb83-12" tabindex="-1"></a>  fit_ctree,</span>
<span id="cb83-13"><a href="#cb83-13" tabindex="-1"></a>  <span class="at">type =</span> <span class="st">&quot;simple&quot;</span>,</span>
<span id="cb83-14"><a href="#cb83-14" tabindex="-1"></a>  <span class="at">gp =</span> grid<span class="sc">::</span><span class="fu">gpar</span>(<span class="at">fontsize =</span> <span class="dv">12</span>, <span class="at">col =</span> plot_palette[<span class="dv">1</span>])</span>
